# dotnet: NuGet's packages and tools, and the revocation lists of DigiCert, which issues NuGet's
# signing certificates, that NuGet checks each package's signatures against; the SDKs mise installs
# for a global.json's version (the install script at dot.net, the SDK's archive). Microsoft's
# telemetry is left out.
api.nuget.org
crl3.digicert.com:80
dot.net
builds.dotnet.microsoft.com
